	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type “gh” followed by part of an owner or repository name.

The workflow lists repositories available to the active GitHub CLI account and opens the selected repository in the default browser.

Repository owner avatars are cached privately in Alfred’s workflow cache and refreshed after seven days.

Requirements:
• Alfred 5 with Powerpack
• GitHub CLI 2.60.0 or later
• An authenticated GitHub.com account

If authentication is required, select “Sign in to GitHub”, complete the GitHub CLI login in Terminal, and enter “gh” in Alfred again.</string>
